  FT["MY-H1378"] = {"id":"MY-H1378","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 145/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年价格管制与反暴利（汽油与柴油最高零售价格核定）（第17号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 17) ORDER 2019","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 17) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (Bilangan 17) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá bán lẻ tối đa đối với xăng và dầu diesel) (số 17) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาขายปลีกสูงสุดสำหรับน้ำมันเบนซินและดีเซล) (ฉบับที่ 17) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Eceran Maksimum untuk Bensin dan Solar) (Nomor 17) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA145","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2019_P.U.(A)145-2019_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1378-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan\n(Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (No. 17) 2019.\n\nHarga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel"}},{"id":"MY-H1378-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel hendaklah sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1378-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum\nbagi Petrol dan Diesel)  (No. 16) 2019 [P.U. (A) 133/2019] yang disiarkan dalam Warta\npada 17 Mei 2019 dibatalkan.\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL)\n(NO. 17) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4\nof the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723 ], the Controller, with the\napproval of the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\nHARGA RUNCIT MAKSIMUM BAGI PETROL DAN DIESEL/\nMAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL\n\nKelas petrol dan diesel/\nClass of petrol and diesel\n\nHarga seliter/\nPrice per litre\n(RM)\n\nPetrol RON97\n\n2.76\n\nPetrol RON95\n\n2.08\n\nDiesel Euro2\n\n2.18\n\nDiesel Euro5\n\n2.28\n\nDibuat 24 Mei 2019\nMade 24 May 2019\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXIV]\n\nDATUK MUEZ BIN ABD AZIZ\nPengawal Harga/\nPrice Controller\n\nDiluluskan 24 Mei 2019\nApproved 24 May 2019\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXIV]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna/\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-3"};
