  FT["MY-H1435"] = {"id":"MY-H1435","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 149/2013&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年医疗（附表二修正）（第2号）令","en":"MEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2013","orig":"MEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Perubatan (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) (Bilangan 2) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Y tế (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ hai) (số 2) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งการแพทย์ (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกที่สอง) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Kedokteran (Perubahan Lampiran Kedua) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA149","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2013_P.U.(A)149-2013_MEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1435-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perubatan (Pindaan Jadual Kedua)\n\n(No. 2) 2013.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H1435-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Akta Perubatan 1971 dipinda dalam Jadual Kedua dengan memasukkan selepas\n\nbutiran \"Ceylon\" dan butir-butir yang terdapat bersetentangan dengannya butiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\nNegara tempat\n\ndiberikan kelulusan\n\nNama Institusi yang\n\nmemberikan kelulusan\n\nPerihal kelulusan\n\n\"China Shanghai Jiao Tong\n\nUniversity School of\n\nMedicine\n\nBachelor of Medicine and\n\nBachelor of Surgery\n\n(Program Lima Tahun)\n\n(Diiktiraf dari 19 Mac 2013\n\nhingga 18 Mac 2016)\n\nShanghai Medical College\n\nof Fudan University\n\nBachelor of Medicine\n\n(Program Lima Tahun)\n\n(Diiktiraf dari 19 Mac 2013\n\nhingga 18 Mac 2016)\n\nBachelor of Medicine and\n\nBachelor of Surgery\n\n(Program Enam Tahun)\n\n(Diiktiraf dari 19 Mac 2013\n\nhingga 18 Mac 2016)\n\nDoctor of Medicine\n\n(Program Lapan Tahun)\n\n(Diiktiraf dari 19 Mac 2013\n\nhingga 18 Mac 2016).\"\n\nDibuat 29 April 2013\n\n[KKM87/A4/7-1/2; PN(PU2)97/VIII]\n\nDATO' SRI LIOW TIONG LAI\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nMEDICAL ACT 1971\n\nMEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(2) of the Medical Act 1971\n\n[Act 50], the Minister, after consulting the Council, makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-3"};
  FT["MY-H1436"] = {"id":"MY-H1436","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 149/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年伊斯兰金融服务（伊斯兰存款的订明日期）令","en":"ISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES (PRESCRIBED DATES FOR ISLAMIC DEPOSITS) ORDER 2014","orig":"ISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES (PRESCRIBED DATES FOR ISLAMIC DEPOSITS) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan Islam (Tarikh yang Ditetapkan bagi Deposit Islam) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Dịch vụ tài chính Hồi giáo (Ngày quy định đối với tiền gửi Hồi giáo) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งบริการการเงินอิสลาม (วันที่กำหนดสำหรับเงินฝากอิสลาม) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Jasa Keuangan Syariah (Tanggal yang Ditetapkan bagi Simpanan Syariah) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA149","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2014_P.U.(A)149-2014_ISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES (PRESCRIBED DATES FOR ISLAMIC DEPOSITS) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1436-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan Islam\n(Tarikh yang Ditetapkan bagi Deposit Islam) 2014.\n\nTarikh yang ditetapkan bagi deposit Islam"}},{"id":"MY-H1436-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri, atas syor Bank, menetapkan tarikh -tarikh yang berikut sebagai tarikh\nyang sehingga bila deposit Islam  yang berikut, yang disetuju terima oleh suatu bank\nIslam berlesen daripada pendeposit di bawah Akta Bank Islam 1983 [ Akta 276 ] yang\ndimansuhkan yang tidak termasuk dalam takrifan deposit Islam di ba wah Akta,\nhendaklah disifatkan sebagai deposit Islam sebagaimana yang ditakrifkan di bawah\nAkta:\n\n(a) dalam hal deposit Islam, 30 Jun 2015; dan\n\n(b) dalam hal suatu deposit Islam berjangka  yang akan dipegang untuk suatu\njangka masa yang ditentukan oleh pendepo sit yang mempunyai tarikh\nmatang selepas 30 Jun 2015, tarikh matang deposit Islam berjangka\ntersebut.\n\nDibuat 19 Mei 2014\n[BNM/JUN/1125/35/35; PN(PU2)717]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES ACT 2013\n\nISLAMIC FINANCIAL SERVICES (PRESCRIBED DATES FOR ISLAMIC DEPOSITS)\nORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 288 of the Islamic Financial Services\nAct 2013 [ Act 759 ], the Minister, on the recommendation of the Bank, makes the\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-3"};
  FT["MY-H1437"] = {"id":"MY-H1437","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 149/2015&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年限速（爱恩斯代尔城互通）令","en":"SPEED LIMIT (BANDAR AINSDALE INTERCHANGE) ORDER 2015","orig":"SPEED LIMIT (BANDAR AINSDALE INTERCHANGE) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Had Laju (Persimpangan Bandar Ainsdale) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ (Nút giao Bandar Ainsdale) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็ว (ทางแยกต่างระดับบันดาร์ไอน์สเดล) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan (Simpang Susun Bandar Ainsdale) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA149","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2015_P.U.(A)149-2015_SPEED LIMIT (BANDAR AINSDALE INTERCHANGE) ORDER 2015.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1437-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju (Persimpangan\n\nBertingkat Bandar Ainsdale) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 10 Julai 2015.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H1437-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Pemanduan suatu kenderaan motor dengan kelajuan yang melebihi had\n\nlaju yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama di atas jalan yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam ruang (1) dilarang.\n\n(2) Jalan dengan had laju yang dinyatakan di bawah subperenggan (1)\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n[subperenggan 2(1)]\n\n(1) (2)\n\nJalan Had laju\n\n(km/j)\n\nBahagian jalan yang dikenali sebagai Lebuh Raya Utara Selatan bermula\n\ndari kilometer 267.160 di koordinat U 101875.018, T 93966.358 Grid\n\nRectified Skew Orthomorphic (RSO) Geosentrik (GDM 2000) dan berakhir di\n\nkoordinat U 102051.281, T 93451.625 Grid RSO (GDM 2000).\n\nBahagian jalan yang dikenali sebagai Lebuh Raya Utara Selatan bermula di\n\nkoordinat U 102051.281, T 93451.625 Grid RSO (GDM 2000) dan berakhir\n\ndi kilometer 268.470 di koordinat U 102407.818, T 92721.886 Grid RSO\n\n(GDM 2000).\n\nBahagian jalan yang dikenali sebagai Lebuh Raya Utara Selatan bermula\n\ndari kilometer 268.330 di koordinat U 102415.520, T 92864.833 Grid RSO\n\n(GDM 2000) dan berakhir di koordinat U 102051.281, T 93451.625 Grid\n\nRSO (GDM 2000).\n\nBahagian jalan yang dikenali sebagai Lebuh Raya Utara Selatan bermula di\n\nkoordinat U 102051.281, T 93451.625 Grid RSO (GDM 2000) dan berakhir\n\ndi kilometer 267.240 di koordinat U 101960.667, T 93937.060 Grid RSO\n\n(GDM 2000).\n\nBahagian jalan yang dikenali sebagai Lebuh Raya Utara Selatan bermula di\n\nkoordinat U 102051.281, T 93451.625 Grid RSO (GDM 2000) dan berakhir\n\ndi Had Sempadan Penyenggaraan (HSP) di koordinat U 100607.272,\n\nT 93853.041 Grid RSO (GDM 2000).\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\n[subperenggan 2(2)]\n\nPETA PERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT BANDAR AINSDALE\n\nDibuat 26 Jun 2015\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/1; PN(PU2)391/XXIX]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Menteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nSPEED LIMIT (BANDAR AINSDALE INTERCHANGE) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(2) of the Road Transport Act 1987\n\n[Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Speed Limit (Bandar Ainsdale\n\nInterchange) Order 2015.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 10 July 2015.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. (1) The driving of a motor vehicle at a speed exceeding the speed limit as\n\nspecified in column (2) of the First Schedule on the road specified in column (1) is\n\nprohibited.\n\n(2) The road with speed limit as specified under subparagraph (1) is shown\n\non the map in the Second Schedule.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[subparagraph 2(1)]\n\n(1) (2)\n\nRoad Speed limit\n\n(km/h)\n\nThe part of the road known as North South Expressway which commence\n\nfrom kilometre 267.160 at coordinates N 101875.018, E 93966.358 of the\n\nRectified Skew Orthomorphic (RSO) Geocentric (GDM 2000) Grid and\n\nending at coordinates N 102051.281, E 93451.625 of the RSO (GDM 2000)\n\nGrid.\n\nThe part of the road known as North South Expressway which commence\n\nfrom coordinates N 102051.281, E 93451.625 of the RSO (GDM 2000) Grid\n\nand ending at kilometer 268.470 at coordinates N 102407.818,\n\nE 92721.886 of the RSO (GDM 2000) Grid.\n\nThe part of the road known as North South Expressway which commence\n\nfrom kilometre 268.330 at coordinates N 102415.520, E 92864.833 of the\n\nRSO (GDM 2000) Grid and ending at coordinates N 102051.281,\n\nE 93451.625 of the RSO (GDM 2000) Grid.\n\nThe part of the road known as North South Expressway which commence\n\nfrom coordinates N 102051.281, E 93451.625 of the RSO (GDM 2000) Grid\n\nand ending at kilometre 267.240 at coordinates N 101960.667,\n\nE 93937.060 of the RSO (GDM 2000) Grid.\n\nThe part of the road known as North South Expressway which commence\n\nfrom coordinates N 102051.281, E 93451.625 of the RSO (GDM 2000) Grid\n\nand ending at Limit of Maintenance Responsibility (LMR) at coordinates\n\nN 100607.272, E 93853.041 of the RSO (GDM 2000) Grid.\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\n[subparagraph 2(2)]\n\nMAP OF BANDAR AINSDALE INTERCHANGE\n\nMade 26 June 2015\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/1; PN(PU2) 391/XXIX]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Minister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-3"};
  FT["MY-H1438"] = {"id":"MY-H1438","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 149/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年国家遗产（国家遗产宣告）（遗产地）令","en":"NATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF NATIONAL HERITAGE) (HERITAGE SITE) ORDER 2016","orig":"NATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF NATIONAL HERITAGE) (HERITAGE SITE) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Warisan Negara (Pengisytiharan Warisan Negara) (Tapak Warisan) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Di sản quốc gia (Tuyên bố di sản quốc gia) (Di chỉ di sản) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งมรดกแห่งชาติ (การประกาศมรดกแห่งชาติ) (แหล่งมรดก) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Warisan Nasional (Penetapan Warisan Nasional) (Situs Warisan) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA149","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2016_P.U.(A)149-2016_NATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF NATIONAL HERITAGE) (HERITAGE SITE) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1438-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Warisan Kebangsaan\n\n(Perisytiharan Warisan Kebangsaan) (Tapak Warisan) 2016.\n\nWarisan Kebangsaan"}},{"id":"MY-H1438-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Tapak yang diperihalkan dalam ruang (1), (2) dan (3) Jadual yang telah\n\nditetapkan sebagai tapak warisan sebagaimana yang disiarkan dalam Warta yang\n\ndiperihalkan dalam ruang (4) dan disenaraikan dalam Daftar diisytiharkan sebagai\n\nWarisan Kebangsaan.\n\nJADUAL\n\nPERIHALAN TAPAK\n\n(1)\n\nNama Pemunya\n\n(2)\n\nNo. Lot/Tapak\n\n(3)\n\nDaerah/Mukim/Negeri\n\n(4)\n\nWarta\n\nPesuruhjaya Hal\n\nEhwal Agama\n\nTerengganu\n\nLot 1686\n\nMasjid Hiliran,\n\nKuala Terengganu\n\nKuala Terengganu\n\nLosong\n\nTerengganu\n\nP.U. (B) 90/2012\n\nDibuat 23 Mei 2016\n\n[JWN.PP.600/3/51/1/1; PN(PU2)652/XIII]\n\nDATO' SERI MOHAMED NAZRI BIN TAN SRI ABDUL AZIZ\n\nMenteri Pelancongan dan Kebudayaan\n\nNATIONAL HERITAGE ACT 2005\n\nNATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF NATIONAL HERITAGE)\n\n(HERITAGE SITE) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 67(1) of the\n\nNational Heritage Act 2005 [Act 645], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the National Heritage (Declaration of National\n\nHeritage) (Heritage Site) Order 2016.\n\nNational Heritage\n\n2. The site described in columns (1), (2) and (3) of the Schedule that has been\n\ndesignated as a heritage site as published in the Gazette described in column (4) and\n\nlisted in the Register is declared to be National Heritage.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nDESCRIPTION OF SITE\n\n(1)\n\nName of Owner\n\n(2)\n\nLot No./Site\n\n(3)\n\nDistrict/Mukim/State\n\n(4)\n\nCommissioner of\n\nReligious Affairs\n\nTerengganu\n\nLot 1686\n\nHiliran Mosque,\n\nKuala Terengganu\n\nKuala Terengganu\n\nLosong\n\nTerengganu\n\nP.U. (B) 90/2012\n\nMade 23 May 2016\n\n[JWN.PP.600/3/51/1/1; PN(PU2)652/XIII]\n\nDATO' SERI MOHAMED NAZRI BIN TAN SRI ABDUL AZIZ\n\nMinister of Tourism and Culture"}}],"pack":"my-3"};
  FT["MY-H1439"] = {"id":"MY-H1439","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 149/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年供应管制（管制物品）（第2号）令","en":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017","orig":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Bekalan (Barang Kawalan) (Bilangan 2) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát nguồn cung (Hàng hóa được kiểm soát) (số 2) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมเสบียง (สิ่งของควบคุม) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Persediaan (Barang yang Dikendalikan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA149","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2017_P.U.(A)149-2017_CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1439-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Bekalan (Barang-Barang\n\nKawalan) (No. 2) 2017.\n\nBarang-barang kawalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1439-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Barang-barang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual diisytiharkan sebagai\n\nbarang-barang kawalan bagi tempoh dari 25 Mei 2017 hingga 2 Jun 2017.\n\nJADUAL\n\nBARANG-BARANG KAWALAN\n\n1. Daging kerbau import (India)\n\n2. Kubis bulat import (Indonesia dan China, tidak termasuk kubis Beijing)\n\n3. Babi hidup\n\n4. Daging babi (perut)\n\n5. Daging babi (daging dan lemak)\n\nDibuat 23 Mei 2017\n\n[KPDN (PGK) (S) 0.5001/4 Jld. 8; PN(PU2)188/VII]\n\n DATO' SERI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\n\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri,\n\nKoperasi dan Kepenggunaan\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES ACT 1961\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 5 of the\n\nControl of Supplies Act 1961 [Act 122], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Control of Supplies (Controlled Articles)\n\n(No. 2) Order 2017.\n\nControlled articles\n\n2. The articles specified in the Schedule are declared to be controlled articles for\n\nthe period from 25 May 2017 to 2 June 2017.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nCONTROLLED ARTICLES\n\n1. Imported buffalo meat (India)\n\n2. Imported round cabbage (Indonesia and China, not including Beijing\n\ncabbage)\n\n3. Live pig\n\n4. Pork (belly)\n\n5. Pork (lean and fat)\n\nMade 23 May 2017\n\n[KPDN (PGK) (S) 0.5001/4 Jld. 8; PN(PU2)188/VII]\n\nDATO' SERI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\n\n Minister of Domestic Trade,\n\nCo-operatives and Consumerism"}}],"pack":"my-3"};
  FT["MY-H144"] = {"id":"MY-H144","coverage":"partial","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=117&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":18,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1967年建筑师法","en":"ARCHITECTS ACT 1967","orig":"ARCHITECTS ACT 1967","vi":"Luật về Kiến trúc sư năm 1967","th":"พระราชบัญญัติสถาปนิก ค.ศ. 1967","id":"Undang-Undang Arsitek Tahun 1967","ms":"Akta Arkitek 1967"},"level":"law","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT117","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1967","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 26 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\1967_117_ARCHITECTS ACT 1967.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H144-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the Architects (Amendment)\nAct, 1972,"}},{"id":"MY-H144-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Section 2 of the Architects Act, 1967 (hereinafter referred\nto as \"the principal Act\") is hereby amended—\n(a) by inserting immediately before the definition of\n\"Architect\", the following definition—\n‘\"appointed date\" means the date appointed\nunder section 1 (2);';\n(5) by substituting for the definition of \"Architect\", the\nfollowing—\n\"Architect\" means a person registered under\nsection 10 (2);';\n(c) by deleting the definition of \"Public Authority\";\n(d) by deleting the definition of \"Register\"; and\n(e) by inserting the following new definition—\n‘\"registered Architectural Graduate\" means a\nperson registered under section 10 (1).'."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Section 3 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\n(a) by substituting for subsection (2), the following—\n\"(2) The Board shall consist of the following\nmembers appointed by the Minister—\n\n(a) a President who shall be appointed from\n~ among Architects;\n\n(b) an Architect who is in the public service of\n\nthe Federation;\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment\nof section 2.\n65/67.\n\nAmendment\nof section 3.\n\nIS. 3-5)\n\n4                     Acr A130\n\n(c) three Architects who are in the service of\nany local authority or statutory authority;\n\n(d) six Architects who have been in private\npractice for at least three years in the\nFederation, three of whom shall be from the\nnomination list submitted by the Council of\nthe Pertubohan Akitek2 Malaysia;\n\n(e) one member on the nomination of the Board\nof Engineers from among members of that\nBoard established under the Registration of\nEngineers Act, 1967;\n\n(f) one member on the nomination of the Board\n\nof Surveyors from among members of that\n\n67/67.      Board established under the Registration of\nSurveyors Act, 1967; and\n\n(g) one member appointed from among building\ndraughtsmen registered under Part V.\";\n\n(b) by inserting the following new subsection (4)—\n\n\"(4) If any member of the Board dies or\nresigns or his appointment is revoked, a new\nmember shall as soon as practicable be appointed\nin his place and the member so appointed shall\nhold office for the remainder of the term for\nwhich his predecessor was appointed.\"; and\n\n(c) by re-numbering the existing subsection (4) as sub-\nsection (5).\n\n66/67.\n\nAmendment 4, Section 4 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\n\nf section 4.\n        (a) by substituting for paragraph (a), the following—\n\"(a) to keep and maintain a Register of Architects\nand a Register of Building Draughtsmen;\";\nand\n(b) by deleting the word \"maximum\" appearing in\nparagraph (d).\n\nAmendment 5, The principal Act is hereby amended by substituting the\nof section 5. following for section 5—\n\n\"Register. 5 The Register of Architects shall be in two\nsections, that is to say—\n(a) Section A—which shall contain the names,\nbusiness addresses and other particulars of\nArchitects; and\n\n[S.\n\nARCHITECTS (AMENDMENT)                        5\n\n(b) Section B—which shall contain the names,\naddresses and other particulars of registered\nArchitectural Graduates.\"."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. Section 6 of the principal Act is hereby amended by\ninserting the words \"of Architects\" immediately after the\nword \"Register\" wherever it appears."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. The principal Act is hreby amended by substituting for\nsection 7, the following—\n\n\"Restrie- 7, (1) No person shall unless he is an Architect—\ntions on un-\n\nei   (a) practise or carry on business or take up\nregistered     employment as an Architect under any\npr     name, style or title bearing the word\nGraduates,         \"Architect\" or the equivalent thereto in any\n\nother language or bearing any other word\nwhatsoever in any language which may\nreasonably be construed to imply that he is\nan Architect;\n\n(b) use or display any sign, board, card or\nother device representing or implying that\nhe is an Architect;\n\n(c) be entitled to recover in any Court any fee,\ncharge or remuneration for any professional\nadvice or services rendered as an Architect.\n\n(2) Notwithstanding the provisions of sub-\nsection (1), a registered Architectural Graduate\nmay with the written approval of the Board take\nup employment as an architect.\","}},{"id":"MY-H144-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. Section 9 of the principal Act is hereby amended by\ninserting the words \"and registered Architectural Graduate\"\nimmediately after the word \"Architect\"."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"en":"9. The principal Act is hereby amended by substituting for\n\nsection 10, the following—\n\nfoualifica- 10. (1) (a) Subject to the provisions of this Act,\n\nregistration, any person who holds the qualification required\nfor Graduate Membership of the Pertubohan\nAkitek? Malaysia or such other qualification as\nthe Board considers to be equivalent thereto,\nshall be entitled on application to be registered\nas an Architectural Graduate.\n\n5-9]\n\nAmendment\nof section 6.\n\nAmendment\nof section 7.\n\nAmendment\nof section 9.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 10.\n\nIS. 9]\n\nAct A130\n\n(b) Subject to the provisions of this Act, a\nperson who is registered as an Architectural\nGraduate under paragraph (a) shall be required\nto obtain such practical experience as may be\nprescribed by the Board after consultation with\nthe Minister and the Pertubohan Akitek2\nMalaysia in order to be entitled to apply for\nregistration as an Architect under subsection (2),\n\n(2) Subject to the provisions of this Act the\nfollowing persons shall be entitled on application\nto be registered under Section A of the Register\nas Architects—\n\n(i) any person who—\n(a) is a registered Architectural Graduate;\n\n(b) has obtained the practical experience as\nprescribed under subsection (1) (5); and\n\n(c) is a Corporate Member of the Pertubohan\nAkitek2 Malaysia or has obtained a\nqualification which the Board considers\nto be equivalent thereto;\n\n(ii) any person who on the appointed date is\nregistered under Part I of the Architects\nOrdinance, 1951;\n\n(ili) any person who was a Corporate Member\nof the Pertubohan Akitek2 Malaysia\nimmediately before the appointed date and\nwho applies for registration within 12\nmonths of that date and on the date of\napplication is a Corporate Member of the\nPertubohan Akitek? Malaysia;\n\n(iv) any person who satisfies the Board that he\nwas practising or was carrying on business\nor was employed as a bona fide architect\nin East Malaysia for at least 12 months\nbefore the appointed date and who applies\nfor registration within 12 months of that\ndate; and\n\n(v) any person who on the appointed date is a\nGraduate Member of the Pertubohan\nAkitek2 Malaysia or is eligible to become\nsuch a Member and is employed as an\narchitect in the Federation and who applies\n\n[S. 9-14]\n\nARCHITECTS (AMENDMENT)                          7\n\nfor registration within 12 months of the\nappointed date and on the date of\napplication is a Corporate Member of the\nPertubohan Akitek? Malaysia or has\nobtained a qualification which the Board\nconsiders to be equivalent thereto.\n\n(3) No person who is not practising as an\narchitect, employed by an Architect or an\narchitectural firm shall be entitled to be registered\nunder this Act.\"."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"en":"10. Section 11 of the principal Act is hereby deleted."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"en":"11. Section 13 of the principal Act is hereby amended by\nsubstituting for subsection (1), the following—\n\n\"(1) The Registrar shall upon receipt of the\nprescribed fee issue to any applicant whose application\nhas been approved by the Board a certificate of\nregistration in the prescribed form.\"."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"text":{"en":"12. Section 14 of the principal Act is hereby amended by\ninserting the words \"and registered Architectural Graduate\"\nimmediately after the word \"Architect\"."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"text":{"en":"13. Section 15 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\n\n(a) by inserting the words \"or registered Architectural\nGraduate\" immediately after the word \"Architect\"\nwherever it appears; and\n\n(b) by substituting for paragraph (c) of subsection (1),\nthe following—\n\n\"(c) if whilst acting in his professional capacity,\nhe at the same time without disclosing the\nfact in writing to his client, is a director or\nmember of or substantial shareholder in or\nagent for any contracting or manufacturing\ncompany or firm or business or have any\nfinancial interest in such company or firm or\nbusiness with which he deals on behalf of his\nclient; or\"."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A14","no":14,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 14"},"text":{"en":"14. Section 16 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\n\n(a) by inserting the words \"of Architects\" immediately\nafter the word \"Register\"; and\n\nDeletion of\nscction 11.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 13.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 14.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 15.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 16.\n\nUS. 14-19]\n\n8                         Act A130\n\n(b) by inserting the words \"or registered Architectural\nGraduate\" immediately after the word \"Architect\".\n\nAmend- 15, Section 17 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\nment of\n\nsection 17.       (a) by inserting the words \"of Architects\" immediately\n\nafter the word \"Register\", wherever it appears; and\n\n(b) by substituting the words \"the date of the order of\ncancellation or from the date of the decision of the\nappeal\" for the words \"the cancellation of his\ncertificate of registration\" appearing in line 5 of\nsubsection (3).\n\nAmen    16. Section 18 of the principal Act is hereby amended by\nsection 18. inserting the words \"of Architects\" immediately after the\n\nword \"Register\".\n\nre ne Section 19 of the principal Act is hereby amended by\nsection 19,  SUbstituting for paragraph (b) in the definition of \"Building\n\nDraughtsman\", the following—\n\n\"(b) any other person whom the Board in its absolute\ndiscretion may deem desirable to register having\nregard to his qualification and experience and to\nthe requirements of any Building Authority or any\nLocal Council;\".\n\nAmend- 18, Section 20 of the principal Act is hereby amended by\nmentot substituting for paragraph (a), the following—\n\n\"(q) practise or carry on business as a building draughts-\nman under any name, style or title bearing the\nwords \"building draughtsman\" or the equivalent\nthereto in any other language or bearing any other\nword whatsoever in any language which may\nreasonably be construed to imply that he is a\nregistered building draughtsman;\".\n\nAmend- 19. Section 21 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\n\nment of\n\nsection 21.       (a) by deleting \"A\";\n\n(b) by inserting the words \"of Building Draughtsmen\"\nimmediately after the word \"Register\" appearing\nin subsection (1); and\n\n(c) by deleting subsection (2).\n\n[S. 20-22]\n\nARCHITECTS (AMENDMENT)                         9"}},{"id":"MY-H144-A20","no":20,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 20"},"text":{"en":"20. Section 22 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\n\n(a) by substituting the following for subsection (3)—\n\n\"(3) The Registrar shall upon receipt of the\nprescribed fee issue to any applicant whose\napplication has been approved by the Board a\ncertificate of registration in the prescribed form\nendorsed with the restrictions that may be\nimposed under section 24.\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting the following new subsection (6)—\n\n\"(6) In any proceedings a list published under\nsubsection (5) shall be prima facie proof that the\npersons whose names appear therein are\nregistered building draughtsmen; and the absence\nof the name of any person from the list shall be\nprima facie proof that the person is not a\nregistered building draughtsman.\"."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A21","no":21,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 21"},"text":{"en":"21. Section 24 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\n\n(a) by substituting for paragraph (a) of subsection (1),\nthe following—\n\n\"(a) he may submit plans only to, and within the\nlimits of the Building Authority or Local\nCouncil for which area his application for\nregistration has been approved; and\";\n\n(b) by substituting for subsection (2) the following—\n\n\"(2) The Board may at any time on the\napplication of a registered building draughtsman\nvary the restrictions for the time being imposed\nupon him pursuant to subsection (1) by substitu-\nting therefor the alternative restriction prescribed\nby subsection (5) or by adding thereto or deleting\ntherefrom any Building Authority or Local\nCouncil specified under paragraph (a) of sub-\nsection (1).\"; and\n\n(c) by substituting the words \"the appointed date\" for\nthe words \"the commencement of this Act\" appear-\ning at the end of the proviso to subsection (5)."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A22","no":22,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 22"},"text":{"en":"22. Subsection (1) of section 25 of the principal Act is\nhereby amended by deleting paragraph (e) and by re-\nnumbering paragraphs (f), (g) and (h) as paragraphs (e), (f)\nand (g) respectively.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 22.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 24.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 25.\n\nIS. 23-27]\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 26.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 27.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 33.\n\nAmend-\nment of\nsection 37.\n\n10                  Act A130"}},{"id":"MY-H144-A23","no":23,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 23"},"text":{"en":"23. Section 26 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\n\n(a) by inserting the words \"of Building Draughtsmen\"\nimmediately after the word \"Register\" appearing\nin line 3; and\n\n(b) by inserting the words \"of Architects\" immediately\nafter the word \"Register\" appearing in line 5.\n\n24, Section 27 of the principal Act is hereby amended by\ninserting the words \"of Building Draughtsmen\" immediately\nafter the word \"Register\"."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A25","no":25,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 25"},"text":{"en":"25. Section 33 of the principal Act is hereby amended—\n\n(a) by substituting for the words \"the Register\" appear-\ning in paragraph (b), the words \"any Register kept\nand maintained under this Act\"; and\n\n(b) by substituting for paragraph (e), the following—\n\n\"(e) personates an Architect or registered Archi-\ntectural Graduate or registered building\ndraughtsman;\"."}},{"id":"MY-H144-A26","no":26,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 26"},"text":{"en":"26. Section 37 of the principal Act is hereby amended by\nsubstituting the words \"the appointed date\" for the words\n\"the commencement of this Act\" and the words \"the coming\ninto force of this Act\".\n\nAmendment 27, The Schedule to the principal Act is hereby amended\n\nof Schedule.\n\nby deleting subparagraph (3) of paragraph 1.\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\nDI-CITETAK OLEH PENCHETAK KERAJAAN DAN DI-TERBITKAN DENGAN PERENTAH PADA\n6HB JULAI, 1972\n\nHarga: 50 sen"}}],"pack":"my-3"};
